{"id":"q-zh-001","status":"draft","question_type":"answerable","question":"印尼对 PMSE 平台经营者和支付服务商有什么营业许可要求？","country":"id","platform":"","gold_answer":"PPMSE 和 PSP 如不属于豁免范围，必须取得 PMSE 领域营业许可（Perizinan Berusaha）。","gold_doc_ids":["ecommerce-19-2026"],"gold_evidence":[{"doc_id":"ecommerce-19-2026","clause_id":"Pasal 7 ayat (1)","must_contain_any":["Perizinan Berusaha"]}],"expected_behavior":"answer_with_citation","notes":"跨语言冒烟题：中文问题，印尼语语料；gold 待核对"}
